<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ranger Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Rangers' guild teaches, in Alquenburg. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name              Level   Up to
Heal Animal           5   60%
Sense Life            6   60%
Locate Animal         9   60%
Refresh              13   70%
Hold Animal          17   50%
Tiger Claw           21   100%
Charm Animal         25   60%
Sense Invisible      28   50%
Eagle Cry            29   100%
Entangle             35   70%
Summon Animal        40   70%
Glowing Fungus       45   50%
</pre>
<p><br />
See Also:
